{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02864",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.51,
      "end_seconds": 5.89,
      "duration_seconds": 5.38,
      "text": "Doctor, hi, where would you like me to put my coat?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.81,
      "end_seconds": 11.99,
      "duration_seconds": 4.18,
      "text": "Come in. Please sit. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.64,
      "end_seconds": 18.39,
      "duration_seconds": 5.75,
      "text": "Well, I've been having a chesty cough for a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.06,
      "end_seconds": 22.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.82,
      "text": "How many days or weeks has it been?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 25.44,
      "end_seconds": 28.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "Since yesterday, that's when it began."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 29.92,
      "end_seconds": 40.28,
      "duration_seconds": 10.36,
      "text": "Alright, tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 42.3,
      "end_seconds": 46.89,
      "duration_seconds": 4.59,
      "text": "It's once or twice a day. It's mild, honestly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 48.79,
      "end_seconds": 50.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.04,
      "text": "Any other symptoms with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 54.78,
      "end_seconds": 65.17,
      "duration_seconds": 10.39,
      "text": "When it starts I tend to get a sore throat earlier as well. With sore throat earlier, it's mild, honestly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 68.68,
      "end_seconds": 72.84,
      "duration_seconds": 4.16,
      "text": "Did you get chest pain, coughing up blood or breathlessness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 74.18,
      "end_seconds": 76.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "Nope, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 76.99,
      "end_seconds": 79.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "Anything different when you pass water?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 80.92,
      "end_seconds": 82.87,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "No, that's all fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 84.09,
      "end_seconds": 88.46,
      "duration_seconds": 4.37,
      "text": "So, any health conditions I should have on record?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 90.46,
      "end_seconds": 97.3,
      "duration_seconds": 6.84,
      "text": "I've had an irregular heartbeat for five years now. Yes, heart disease."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 99.19,
      "end_seconds": 109.5,
      "duration_seconds": 10.31,
      "text": "Okay, I can see an irregular heartbeat in your file as well. Are you taking anything regularly, including from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 110.89,
      "end_seconds": 119.31,
      "duration_seconds": 8.42,
      "text": "It's, It's metoprolol, 50 milligrams, twice a day. I'm on honey and lemon, at night."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 131.23,
      "end_seconds": 133.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "Have you had any surgical procedures?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 134.71,
      "end_seconds": 140.96,
      "duration_seconds": 6.25,
      "text": "I had two stents put in my heart three years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 152.89,
      "end_seconds": 154.88,
      "duration_seconds": 1.99,
      "text": "Do you do any exercise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 156.46,
      "end_seconds": 159.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "I swim twice a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 160.46,
      "end_seconds": 164.26,
      "duration_seconds": 3.8,
      "text": "What does a normal day of food look like?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 165.7,
      "end_seconds": 169.61,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 178.33,
      "end_seconds": 182.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "Let me get the readings out of the way."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 189.35,
      "end_seconds": 192.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "Keep your arm relaxed for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 207.85,
      "end_seconds": 217.09,
      "duration_seconds": 9.24,
      "text": "Okay: pulse 75, blood pressure 118 over 74, respiratory rate 17, temperature is 36.5 degrees, oxygen saturation is 98 percent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 218.73,
      "end_seconds": 220.08,
      "duration_seconds": 1.35,
      "text": "Is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 221.61,
      "end_seconds": 225.03,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "Don't worry, we'll discuss it in a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 226.5,
      "end_seconds": 230.16,
      "duration_seconds": 3.66,
      "text": "I'll examine you in a second, make yourself comfortable."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 231.39,
      "end_seconds": 233.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.14,
      "text": "Tell me if that's sore."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 250.95,
      "end_seconds": 255.01,
      "duration_seconds": 4.06,
      "text": "Your chest is clear and your oxygen is normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 260.99,
      "end_seconds": 262.56,
      "duration_seconds": 1.57,
      "text": "That's the examination finished."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 278.21,
      "end_seconds": 294.83,
      "duration_seconds": 16.62,
      "text": "So where does that leave us? My working impression is acute viral bronchitis. Antibiotics will not help; fluids, rest and honey are best and the cough can last three weeks. That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 296.24,
      "end_seconds": 297.8,
      "duration_seconds": 1.56,
      "text": "That's clear, thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 303.33,
      "end_seconds": 304.5,
      "duration_seconds": 1.17,
      "text": "Look after yourself."
    }
  ]
}